# Copy this file to secrets.toml (same folder, next to FinanceEmail.py) and fill in your own value.
# secrets.toml is in .gitignore, so it never goes to GitHub. Never commit the real one.
#
# Gmail app password for the payday email (16 letters, from your Google account > Security > App passwords).
